        card("Activity 11: the gist (the book’s key)", "The Philippine Coast Guard is now on alert because of the anticipated effect of the typhoon. According to the Coast Guard spokesman, Arman Balillo, all sea vessels are suspended from sailing in places declared under storm signals. Meanwhile the Coast Guard reminded residents along coastal areas to stay alert for the possible surge of ocean waters."),
